silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_09_validation_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'ValidationLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Validation Leg', the validation_leg_arrow SHACLPassReport_77 -> MittensColimitApex: the SHACL pass-report leg; monic (this specific validation receipt is unique to VetRecord_77 in this diagram) but not epic.; also, In 'Validation Leg', the record_validation_arrow VetRecord_77 -> SHACLPassReport_77: the record is the subject of this validation; the pass-report is produced by running the SHACL validator on VetRecord_77; monic because this report is specific to this record." .
